   "text": "reads USER.md + MEMORY.md and pastes\nthem into Claude's context, plus:\n  \u00b7 how many items wait for approval\n  \u00b7 'check okf_lookup' if a bundle is set\nindexes new chat transcripts into\narchive.db (3-second budget)",
   "originalText": "reads USER.md + MEMORY.md and pastes\nthem into Claude's context, plus:\n  \u00b7 how many items wait for approval\n  \u00b7 'check okf_lookup' if a bundle is set\nindexes new chat transcripts into\narchive.db (3-second budget)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
