   "text": "\"yes\"          \u2192 #4 approved, saved\n\"no\"           \u2192 #4 rejected\n\"change it to\u2026\" \u2192 rejected, Claude\n                 re-proposes it\nanything else  \u2192 disarmed, no change\nevery 6 prompts: a nudge to save\nanything worth keeping",
